{"id":"input-88e5e7870d31","steamAppId":"699240","name":"Keyboard Killers","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699240/library_600x900.jpg","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/699240/","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"unknown","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":0.4,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"400 MB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","steamTags":["Indie","Casual","Simulation","Action","Typing","Great Soundtrack","Arcade","Pixel Graphics","Difficult","Sci-fi","Physics","Space","Atmospheric","Replay Value"],"sourceProfile":{"shortDescription":"Keyboard Killers is a difficult reflex game in which you destroy meteors in order to save your starship and your friend dragon(^-^) . You must be very fast to able to complete the game. More then 500 apm on most challenging levels.","developers":["Heaven Brotherhood"]},"content":{"status":"success","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:39:32.707695+00:00","identityStatus":"verified","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","shortDescription":"Keyboard Killers is a difficult reflex game in which you destroy meteors in order to save your starship and your friend dragon(^-^) . You must be very fast to able to complete the game. More then 500 apm on most challenging levels.","detailedDescription":"Keyboard Killers is a difficult reflex game in which you destroy meteors in order to save your starship and your friend dragon.\n\n- 28 different levels\n\n- 4 difficulty level\n\n- Each level has its own cool rock song\n\n- Create your own music on the special level with 22 various sounds\n\nBy playing for a long time you can learn to type blindly (or you can destroy your keyboard)"},"vi":{"status":"translated","shortDescription":"Sát thủ bàn phím là một trò chơi phản xạ khó mà trong đó bạn phá hủy thiên thạch để cứu phi thuyền và bạn rồng của bạn. Anh phải rất nhanh chóng mới có thể hoàn thành trò chơi. Sau đó là 500 vòng trên hầu hết các mức độ thách thức.","detailedDescription":"Sát thủ bàn phím là một trò chơi phản xạ khó mà trong đó bạn phá hủy thiên thạch để cứu phi thuyền và rồng bạn của bạn.\n- 28 tầng khác nhau.\n- 4 khó khăn cấp\n- Mỗi tầng đều có một bài hát rất hay.\n- Tạo ra âm nhạc riêng ở mức độ đặc biệt với 22 âm thanh khác nhau\nBằng cách chơi trong một thời gian dài, bạn có thể học cách gõ mù quáng (hoặc bạn có thể phá hủy bàn phím)"}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699240/header.jpg?t=1788344985"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699240/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788344985"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699240/ss_4bad7017717bdbf2f49e6b2372341b965b817740.600x338.jpg?t=1788344985","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699240/ss_4bad7017717bdbf2f49e6b2372341b965b817740.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788344985"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699240/ss_3b04629d9219ca4af590ad0fc014b2694b0e05d3.600x338.jpg?t=1788344985","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699240/ss_3b04629d9219ca4af590ad0fc014b2694b0e05d3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788344985"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699240/ss_a926e130e806219e4e974cf59d15225ef448ee9c.600x338.jpg?t=1788344985","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699240/ss_a926e130e806219e4e974cf59d15225ef448ee9c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788344985"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699240/ss_b5c2704e74b595410b4edae47219f4822f816502.600x338.jpg?t=1788344985","url"